d as your arcane focus, roll an ability check with yoursellcasting ability score. If you roll higher than 11 + thesell's level, you cast thesell without using asellslot. This fails if you have nosellslots remaining of thesell's level and therefore couldn't cast without succeeding.;Wand of Lightning Bolts;16805g 6s 3c;11853g 3s 3c;This wand can unleash powerful bolts of lightning upon command.;Wand of Neutralize Poison;1622g 5s 7c;1160g 3s 1c;(13 of 50 charges) This distinctive wand also grants the magical ability to endure extreme cold for one hour per day.;Whispering Amulet;107g 3s 6c;78g 3s 7c; An enchanted amulet that allows the wearer to communicate telepathically with nearby allies.;White Onyx;42g 7s 7c;33g 8c;--;oil of bless weapon;101g 1s 8c;70g 2s 5c;This white draught smells like mint.;yellow Quartz;60g 7s 8c;47g 6s 8c;--
